    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1; padding-left: 20px;">
      <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 15px; border-radius: 5px;">
        <h4 style="margin-top: 0;">PERMISSION:</h4>
        <p>Always ask permission to have someone listed as a reference</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <div style="flex: 1; padding-right: 20px;">
      <p style="font-weight: bold;">Name, Credentials (PhD, CPA, RN, etc.)</p>
      <p>Title</p>
      <p>Organization</p>
      <p>Organization's Address</p>
      <p>City, State, Zip</p>
      <p>Work Phone</p>
      <p>Work Email</p>
      <p>Relationship: (supervisor, professor, etc.)</p>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1; padding-left: 20px;">
      <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 15px; border-radius: 5px;">
        <h4 style="margin-top: 0;">UPDATE YOUR REFERENCES:</h4>
        <p>Be sure to notify each reference prior to applying/ when you get an interview</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 50px; font-size: 12px; color: #555;">
    Daemen College Career Services • Wick Center • www.daemen.edu/career • 716.839.8334
  </div>
